  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a claypot over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and stir-fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the HP sauce, soy sauce, and rice vinegar, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Melt the tempering chocolate and stir it into the sauce.",
    "Serve the pork and sauce hot, garnished with sliced scallions.",
    "Cook the sauce for an additional 2 minutes, or until it has thickened slightly."
